    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5b2b244f",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a photo of a woman (identified as Rep. Ilhan Omar) with an image of the 9/11 attacks, using text that falsely claims she 'forgot' the 9/11 attacks. This is a harmful and misleading meme that attempts to delegitimize her by falsely implying she is ungrateful or ignorant of a national tragedy. The meme is designed to provoke outrage and attack her character, potentially inciting hostility toward her or her supporters. It is not abusive or explicitly hateful toward a protected group, but it is harmful because it misrepresents a public figure and uses a traumatic historical event for political attack, which can cause emotional distress and contribute to a hostile political environment. The intent is to discredit her by association with the 9/11 attacks, which is a form of political propaganda and character assassination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cec4f3a5"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
